hashes are in .build/floating-targeted/module-uniform-20260928/:
  harden/{build,runtime}.json, harden-isolated/runtime.json,
  harden-profile/runtime.json, harden-completion/runtime.json.
No large disk copies. This closes K11l's source-bound timeout classification,
not the original test, K11 parent or K13. CPU/code-generation performance remains
a separate compiler optimization task, not an excuse to mark the timeout PASS.
